WP03, this is authoritative; ignore the 'unary / T[run][c]' proposal of WP04 and its 'gap above the highest coefficient' (there is no such syntax element: total_zeros counts only zeros BELOW the last coefficient in scan order).

Table 9-10 run_before, as bit strings, columns zerosLeft = 1,2,3,4,5,6,>6:
 run 0 : 1   1   11  11  11   11   111
 run 1 : 0   01  10  10  10   000  110
 run 2 : -   00  01  01  011  001  101
 run 3 : -   -   00  001 010  011  100
 run 4 : -   -   -   000 001  010  011
 run 5 : -   -   -   -   000  101  010
 run 6 : -   -   -   -   -    100  001
 run 7..14 (zerosLeft > 6 only): 0001, 00001, 000001, 0000001, 00000001, 000000001, 0000000001, 00000000001  (run r: r-4 zeros then a 1; lengths 4..11)

Writer (clause 7.3.5.3.2), with pos[0..n-1] the scan positions of the n non-zero coefficients in increasing order and total_zeros = pos[n-1] + 1 - n (minus the start offset for AC blocks whose scan starts at 1):
  zerosLeft = total_zeros;
  for (i = n - 1; i >= 1 && zerosLeft > 0; i--) {
      run = pos[i] - pos[i-1] - 1;
      put(table[run][min(zerosLeft,7)]);
      zerosLeft -= run;
  }
  /* the lowest coefficient's run is implied (= zerosLeft): nothing is written for it */
Check with the worked example in your task text: positions 1,3,4,5,7 -> total_zeros 3 -> '10' (run 1, zL 3), '1' (run 0, zL 2), '1' (run 0, zL 2), '01' (run 1, zL 2) = 10 1 1 01, the tail of 000010001110010111101101. Add WP10's non-palindromic case to the unit test: positions 0,1,4,5,9: total_zeros 5; runs written high to low: 3 (zL 5: 010), 0 (zL 2: 1), 2 (zL 2: 00), then zL 0 stop.
Also required now: (a) n2bw_trailing / n2bw_align_zero must return when w->overflow is set (WP10's fix); (b) a table entry of length 0 must never be emitted silently: assert in the host build.
WP04: please do not post standard tables from memory as verified; your P-slice files are fine. WP03: when 176x144 intra-only QP 20/26/32 on 'noise' and 'gradient' are bit-exact against ffmpeg, post immediately -- the phone payload waits only on that. If you are not there in 25 minutes I take over avc/n2avc_cavlc.c and n2avc_tables.h myself.
